 flowchart TD
-    P["Prepared model"] --> B["Candidate batch"]
-    B --> V["Validate IDs and budgets"]
-    V -->|Single worker or candidate| S["Inline evaluation"]
-    V -->|Multiple workers| W["Scoped worker evaluation"]
